    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, 300% increase? Where did those numbers come from? Our internal report says the coral health only went up by 5%. I don't want to get flagged for fraud, but I also can't let this grant slip through our fingers because our numbers look \"average.\" Is there a way to spin that 5% so it sounds like a massive win without actually making up fake stats?",
